<title>MEXICO: Chic by HIS to start north Mexico operation.</title>
<headline>Chic by HIS to start north Mexico operation.</headline>
<dateline>GUADALAJARA, Mexico 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. apparel firm Chic by H.I.S. Inc will begin manufacturing denim products in the northern Mexican state of Durango in January, the Durango City mayor's office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The investment...is approximately $4.5 million,&quot; said Durango's deputy mayor Jaime Fiscal.</p>
<p>Fiscal added that the company would mainly produce jeans and jackets in Durango for export to the U.S. market.</p>
<p>-- Monica Ballesca, Guadalajara bureau +523 817-0397</p>
</text>
